@startuml UC-PROJECT-ARCHIVE
' UC-11 - Archive Project | semantic key: UC-PROJECT-ARCHIVE
' Source: data/use_cases/project-membership/UC-PROJECT-ARCHIVE.yml
' Business Rules: BR-PROJECT-OWNER-ADMINISTRATION, BR-PROJECT-ARCHIVED-READ-ONLY
' Trace comments ' [ref] name the YAML element behind the next action.
' No title: the Word caption supplies it.
' One Activity Final shared by all paths (team decision 2026-10-05; UML allows one or several). It
' is reached after the project is archived (postconditions met) or with the project unchanged
' (EX-01, AF-01).
' Layout (2026-10-06): the decision "Confirm archival?" is drawn in the System lane, where the
' System waits for the Project Owner's answer; the guards name the Project Owner's choice. In the
' Project Owner lane its merge forced a detour across the lanes.
!include ../../_shared/activity-style.puml
|OWN| $lane_title("Project Owner")
|SYS| $lane_title("System")

|OWN|
start
' [NF1]
:Request project archival;
|SYS|
' [NF2]
:Check for an active Sprint;
if ($question("Active Sprint?")) then ($guard_left("[none]"))
  ' [NF3]
  :Summarize effects and
  request confirmation;
  if ($question("Confirm archival?")) then ($guard_left("[confirm]"))
    |OWN|
    ' [NF4]
    :Confirm archival;
    |SYS|
    ' [NF5, POST1, POST2, BR-PROJECT-ARCHIVED-READ-ONLY]
    :Mark project and work read-only;
  else ($guard_right("[cancel", "— AF-01]"))
    |SYS|
    ' [AF-01.1]
    :Leave project
    active and unchanged;
  endif
else ($guard_right("[active Sprint", "— EX-01]"))
  ' [EX-01, GUIDE-7.3]
  :Reject project archival;
endif
|SYS|
stop
@enduml
